in >5% accuracy, then GRPO recovery comparison.（准备中）\n40\t\n41\t## 近期结论\n42\t- **grpo_rasp_20_4096** (failed): D010: RASP-pruned model (20% sparsity, post-prune 29% GSM8K) GRPO recovery with max_completion_length=4096 (fix D009 truncation). Core MVP experiment — if recovery succeeds, RASP structure selection enables RLVR recovery that standard pruning cannot. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\n43\t- **grpo_standard_20_4096** (negative): D010: Standard-pruned model (20% sparsity, post-prune 1% GSM8K) GRPO recovery with max_completion_length=4096 (fix D009 truncation). Negative control — expected to fail recovery due to non-optimal structure selection, confirming RASP advantage. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\n44\t- **grpo_standard_20_fast** (negative): Standard-pruned model (20% sparsity, post-prune 1% GSM8K) expected to fail GRPO recovery (RewardDesertCallback triggers). This is the negative control — confirms RASP's structure selection enables recovery that standard pruning cannot. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\n45\t\n46\t## 趋势\n47\t成功 0 / 负向 4 / 失败 3 / 共 9\n48\t\n49\t## 下一步\n50\t（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\n51\t\n52\t## 资源状态\n53\twestb-23072: 无 GPU 信息\n54\t\n55\t## 告警\n56\t- mvp_rasp_pipeline: 训练失败 — unknown\n57\t- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\n58\t- grpo_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\n59\t- grpo_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\n60\t- grpo_rasp_20_4096: 训练失败 — unknown\n61\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Grq38H1uuBXWm7ctAsRR2q","session_id":"50085846-2f4c-49ad-8f2d-ef8b9b74cc58","uuid":"abd784d1-ae00-474e-b3e0-efa56052605d","timestamp":"2026-05-14T23:45:00.494Z"}
