t_prune/memory.md:GRASPrune(DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, keep_ratio=0.65)\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/memory.md:  --model-id /root/autodl-tmp/models/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B \\\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/memory.md:  --model-id /root/autodl-tmp/models/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B \\\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/memory.md:1. **Qwen 的 bias**: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 的 attention 有 bias（q_proj, k_proj, v_proj 有 bias），GRASPrune 的 `QwenAttnGate.materialize_pruning()` 已正确处理 bias 的 slicing。\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/memory.md:**问题**：`prune.py` 中 `min_keep_mlp=4`（绝对值），DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 每层 28 MLP groups。全局贪心排序将 early layers (0-6) 集中剪至仅保留 4/28 = 14.3% capacity，摧毁初始表征，模型崩溃到 0.15% accuracy。两个不同的剪枝方法（Standard + RASP）产出 accuracy 精确相同（2/1319），因为都被剪崩了——差异被噪声淹没。\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/memory.md:35% structured sparsity 在 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 上完全摧毁推理能力（0-1% accuracy），即使有 per-layer 40% capacity floor。原因是 distillation 已经消除了冗余（distilled model 的 capacity 利用率更高），structured pruning 进一步移除结构会打破 distillation 学到的紧凑表征。20% sparsity 是 distilled 7B 模型的可行操作点。\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/paper_framing.md:- **Headline result template**: \"At 20% structured sparsity on DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, RASP preserves 29% GSM8K accuracy (vs 1% for standard pruning), enabling RLVR recovery to X% while standard-pruned models remain unrecoverable. Per-structure CKA overlap explains Y% of variance in recovery outcomes (mixed-effects β = Z, p < 0.001).\"\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/paper_framing.md:- Reasoning model compression is timely (DeepSeek-R1, QwQ, etc. driving demand)\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/paper_framing.md:- **\"Single model\"**: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B is the most widely-used open reasoning model; multi-sparsity + multi-method comparison compensates","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Grq38H1uuBXWm7ctAsRR2q","session_id":"50085846-2f4c-49ad-8f2d-ef8b9b74cc58","uuid":"73ff7c6b-fa3f-4c56-b40f-cd1d3b3b99fc","timestamp":"2026-05-14T23:45:09.813Z"}
