{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Sn89U4k5o6gwVMd6Zn6MGk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# GRASPrune 调研报告 — Phase 2 P1 Baseline 实现方案\n2\t\n3\t> 调研日期: 2026-05-14\n4\t> 目标: 将 GRASPrune 作为 Phase 2 P1 的额外 baseline pruning method\n5\t\n6\t---\n7\t\n8\t## 1. GRASPrune 概述\n9\t\n10\t**论文**: GRASPrune: Global Gating for Budgeted Structured Pruning of Large Language Models\n11\t**会议**: ACL 2026 Main Conference\n12\t**arXiv**: 2604.19398\n13\t**代码**: https://github.com/ZiY-Wang/GRASPrune\n14\t**作者**: Ziyang Wang, Jiangfeng Xiao, Chuan Xiao, Ruoxiang Li, Rui Mao, Jianbin Qin\n15\t\n16\tGRASPrune 是一个 post-training structured pruning 框架，对 decoder-only LLM 做 FFN channel 和 attention KV group 的联合剪枝。核心特点：\n17\t- **Global gating**: 所有层的 FFN channel 和 KV group 共享一个全局 budget\n18\t- **Projected STE**: 每个 training step 都投影到 budget-feasible 的 hard mask\n19\t- **Rescale compensation**: 剪枝后学习 scaling factor 补偿 scale mismatch\n20\t- 支持 LLaMA 和 **Qwen** 架构（直接兼容我们的 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B）\n21\t\n22\t---\n23\t\n24\t## 2. 核心算法\n25\t\n26\t### 2.1 问题形式化\n27\t\n28\t将 structured pruning 建模为 budget-constrained binary optimization：\n29\t\n30\t$$\\min_{z \\in \\{0,1\\}^{|S|}} \\mathcal{L}(\\theta; z) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum_{i \\in S} c_i z_i \\leq B$$\n31\t\n32\t其中：\n33\t- $S$ = 所有可剪枝 structural unit 的集合（FFN channels + KV groups across all layers）\n34\t- $z_i \\in \\{0,1\\}$: unit $i$ 的保留标志\n35\t- $c_i$: unit $i$ 的参数代价\n36\t- $B = \\rho \\sum_{i \\in S} c_i$: 全局 budget，$\\rho$ = keep_ratio\n37\t\n38\t### 2.2 代价模型 (Cost Model)\n39\t\n40\t**FFN channel**: $c_i = 1$（归一化单位代价）\n41\t\n42\t**KV group (attention)**: \n43\t$$\\alpha = \\frac{(2G + 2) d_h}{3}$$\n44\t\n45\t其中 $G = H / H^{kv}$（query-to-KV head ratio），$d_h$ = head_dim。\n46\t\n47\t对于 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B：\n48\t- $H = 28$, $H^{kv} = 4$, $G = 7$, $d_h = 128$\n49\t- $\\alpha = (2 \\times 7 + 2) \\times 128 / 3 = 16 \\times 128 / 3 \\approx 682.67$\n50\t\n51\t### 2.3 Gate Parameterization\n52\t\n53\t为每个 structural unit 引入可学习 scalar gate $s_i$：\n54\t- **FFN**: `gate_score` — shape `(intermediate_size,)` = `(18944,)` per layer\n55\t- **KV group**: `gate_score_kv` — shape `(num_key_value_heads,)` = `(4,)` per layer\n56\t\n57\tSoft probability: $p_i = \\sigma(s_i / \\tau)$，其中 $\\tau = 1.5$ 为 temperature。\n58\t\n59\t### 2.4 Projected Straight-Through Estimator (PSTE)\n60\t\n61\t**Forward pass** (hard mask)：\n62\t1. 收集所有 gate 的 soft probabilities $\\{p_i\\}$\n63\t2. Budget projection `Project(p, c, B)`：\n64\t   - 按 $p_i$ 降序排列\n65\t   - 贪心选择 $m_i = 1$ 直到 $\\sum c_i m_i \\leq B$\n66\t   - 复杂度: $O(n \\log n)$ 排序 + $O(n)$ 扫描\n67\t3. 得到 hard mask $\\hat{m}$\n68\t\n69\t**STE trick** (soft backward)：\n70\t$$\\tilde{z}_i = m_i + (p_i - \\text{stopgrad}(p_i))$$\n71\t\n72\tForward 用 hard mask $m_i \\in \\{0,1\\}$，backward 梯度穿过 soft $p_i$：\n73\t$$\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial s_i} = \\frac{1}{\\tau} \\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial \\tilde{z}_i} p_i(1 - p_i)$$\n74\t\n75\t**Training objective**：\n76\t$$\\tilde{\\mathcal{L}}(s) = \\mathbb{E}_x[\\mathcal{L}(f(x; \\theta, \\hat{m}(p(s))))]$$\n77\t\n78\t其中 $\\theta$ 冻结，只优化 gate scores $\\{s_i\\}$。\n79\t\n80\t### 2.5 Rescale Compensation (Stage B)\n81\t\n82\tHard mask 固定后，对保留 unit 学习 multiplicative scaling：\n83\t$$\\text{output}_i = m_i \\cdot (1 + \\alpha_r \\cdot \\tanh(s_i)) \\cdot \\text{activation}_i$$\n84\t\n85\t其中 $\\alpha_r = 0.5$（rescale_alpha）。学习完成后，scaling factor 折叠进 weight matrix，推理时无额外开销。\n86\t\n87\t### 2.6 算法伪代码\n88\t\n89\t```\n90\tAlgorithm: GRASPrune Pipeline\n91\t\n92\tInput: pretrained model θ, keep_ratio ρ, calibration data D\n93\tOutput: pruned dense checkpoint\n94\t\n95\t# Stage A: Gate Training\n96\t1. Attach gate scores {s_i} to all FFN channels and KV groups, init s_i = 0\n97\t2. Freeze all backbone weights θ\n98\t3. Compute cost vector c (FFN: 1.0, KV group: α)\n99\t4. Budget B = ρ * Σ c_i\n100\t5. For epoch = 1..4:\n101\t     For batch x in D:\n102\t       p_i = sigmoid(s_i / τ)  for all i\n103\t       m = Project(p, c, B)    # greedy top-k by probability\n104\t       z̃_i = m_i + (p_i - stopgrad(p_i))  # STE\n105\t       Apply z̃ as mask to FFN channels and KV groups\n106\t       loss = CrossEntropyLoss(model(x; θ, z̃), x)\n107\t       Backprop through z̃ → update {s_i} via AdamW\n108\t\n109\t# Finalize Hard Masks\n110\t6. Compute final p_i, run Project → get final hard masks\n111\t7. Register masks on all gate modules\n112\t\n113\t# Stage B: Rescale Compensation\n114\t8. Zero gate scores, enable rescale mode\n115\t9. For epoch = 1..1:\n116\t     For batch x in D_val:\n117\t       Apply mask with rescale: output_i = m_i * (1 + 0.5 * tanh(s_i)) * act_i\n118\t       loss = CrossEntropyLoss(model(x), x)\n119\t       Backprop → update {s_i}\n120\t\n121\t# Export\n122\t10. Materialize pruning: physically remove pruned dimensions from weight matrices\n123\t11. Fold rescale factors into weights\n124\t12. Export pruned_state_dict.safetensors + meta.json\n125\t```\n126\t\n127\t---\n128\t\n129\t## 3. 与现有方法的对比\n130\t\n131\t| 特性 | Standard (我们的) | RASP (我们的) | GRASPrune (baseline) |\n132\t|------|-------------------|---------------|---------------------|\n133\t| Scoring | Taylor: $I(h) = \\|w_h \\cdot g_h\\|_2$ | $S(h) = I(h) \\cdot (1-F(h))^\\alpha$ | Learned gates via PSTE |\n134\t| 优化方式 | One-shot (无迭代) | One-shot (无迭代) | 迭代 gate training (4 epochs) |\n135\t| Budget 约束 | 事后贪心裁剪 | 事后贪心裁剪 | 每步投影到 feasible set |\n136\t| Attn 粒度 | Q head → 推导 KV | Q head → 推导 KV | **直接 KV group** |\n137\t| MLP 粒度 | n_heads 个 group | n_heads 个 group | **Per-channel** |\n138\t| 补偿 | 无 | 无 | Rescale compensation |\n139\t| 校准数据 | GSM8K train | GSM8K train | WikiText2 train |\n140\t| 耗时 | ~10 min (importance) | ~30 min (importance+CKA) | ~6 min (A100 80G) |\n141\t\n142\t### 关键区别：\n143\t1. **GRASPrune 的 attention pruning 天然在 KV group 粒度**，`gate_score_kv` shape = `(num_key_value_heads,)`。这完美满足我们的 GQA group 硬约束。\n144\t2. **MLP pruning 更细粒度**: per-channel 而非 per-group，理论上更优但也更多参数要学。\n145\t3. **有 rescale 补偿**: 这给 GRASPrune 额外优势，公平起见实验中可能需要注意。\n146\t\n147\t---\n148\t\n149\t## 4. 集成方案\n150\t\n151\t### 4.1 推荐方案: 直接使用 GRASPrune 官方代码\n152\t\n153\tGRASPrune 已原生支持 Qwen 架构，输出格式 (safetensors + meta.json) 与我们的 `load_pruned_model()` 完全兼容。\n154\t\n155\t**Pipeline**：\n156\t```\n157\tGRASPrune(DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, keep_ratio=0.65)\n158\t    → pruned_state_dict.safetensors + meta.json\n159\t    → load_pruned_model()  # 用我们的 rebuild.py\n160\t    → GRPO recovery training\n161\t    → eval (GSM8K)\n162\t```\n163\t\n164\t**服务器部署步骤**：\n165\t```bash\n166\t# 1. Clone GRASPrune 到服务器\n167\tcd /root\n168\tgit clone https://github.com/ZiY-Wang/GRASPrune.git\n169\tcd GRASPrune\n170\tpip install -r requirements.txt\n171\t\n172\t# 2. 运行 GRASPrune pruning (keep_ratio=0.65 ↔ 35% sparsity)\n173\tpython train.py \\\n174\t  --model-id /root/autodl-tmp/models/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B \\\n175\t  --model-family qwen \\\n176\t  --trust-remote-code \\\n177\t  --device cuda:0 \\\n178\t  --keep-ratio 0.65 \\\n179\t  --epochs 4 \\\n180\t  --num-samples 512 \\\n181\t  --max-len 512 \\\n182\t  --batch-size 1 \\\n183\t  --output-dir /root/recovery_aware_struct_prune/outputs/graspune_qwen7b_65\n184\t\n185\t# 3. 验证 pruned model\n186\tpython eval_pruned_ppl.py \\\n187\t  --model-id /root/autodl-tmp/models/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B \\\n188\t  --sd /root/recovery_aware_struct_prune/outputs/graspune_qwen7b_65/pruned_state_dict.safetensors \\\n189\t  --meta /root/recovery_aware_struct_prune/outputs/graspune_qwen7b_65/meta.json \\\n190\t  --trust-remote-code \\\n191\t  --use-fast-tokenizer \\\n192\t  --device cuda:0\n193\t\n194\t# 4. 接入我们的 GRPO recovery pipeline\n195\tcd /root/recovery_aware_struct_prune\n196\tpython src/train_grpo.py \\\n197\t  --pruned_model_path /root/recovery_aware_struct_prune/outputs/graspune_qwen7b_65 \\\n198\t  ...\n199\t```\n200\t\n201\t### 4.2 meta.json 格式兼容性\n202\t\n203\tGRASPrune 的 `meta.json` 格式：\n204\t```json\n205\t{\n206\t  \"model_id\": \"...\",\n207\t  \"model_family\": \"qwen\",\n208\t  \"dtype\": \"torch.bfloat16\",\n209\t  \"export_format\": \"materialized\",\n210\t  \"rescale_alpha\": 0.5,\n211\t  \"layers\": [\n212\t    {\n213\t      \"ffn_intermediate_size\": 12345,\n214\t      \"num_heads\": 21,\n215\t      \"num_key_value_heads\": 3,\n216\t      \"head_dim\": 128\n217\t    },\n218\t    ...\n219\t  ]\n220\t}\n221\t```\n222\t\n223\t我们的 `rebuild.py` 中 `rebuild_from_meta()` 读取 `meta[\"layers\"]` 的 `ffn_intermediate_size`、`num_heads`、`num_key_value_heads`、`head_dim`，然后 resize linear layers 并 load state_dict。两边完全兼容，无需修改。\n224\t\n225\t### 4.3 需要注意的兼容性问题\n226\t\n227\t1. **Qwen 的 bias**: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 的 attention 有 bias（q_proj, k_proj, v_proj 有 bias），GRASPrune 的 `QwenAttnGate.materialize_pruning()` 已正确处理 bias 的 slicing。\n228\t\n229\t2. **GQA group 映射**: GRASPrune 的 attention materialization 逻辑：\n230\t   ```python\n231\t   # gate_score_kv shape = (num_key_value_heads,) = (4,)\n232\t   # keep_kv: bool mask on KV heads\n233\t   # keep_heads = keep_kv.repeat_interleave(group_size)  # expand to Q heads\n234\t   # group_size = num_heads // num_key_value_heads = 28 // 4 = 7\n235\t   ```\n236\t   这正是我们要求的 GQA group 粒度: 1 KV head + 7 Q heads = 1 group。\n237\t\n238\t3. **校准数据**: GRASPrune 默认用 WikiText2 train，我们的 importance/CKA 用 GSM8K train。为公平对比，可以考虑让 GRASPrune 也用 GSM8K（需要修改 `data.py` 或 `config.train_dataset_name`）。\n239\t\n240\t---\n241\t\n242\t## 5. 参考代码关键片段\n243\t\n244\t### 5.1 Gate 注入 (`gates.py`)\n245\t\n246\t```python\n247\t# FFN gate: per-channel scalar\n248\tclass LlamaMLPGate(nn.Module):\n249\t    def __init__(self, cfg, src, gate_init, tau, device):\n250\t        self.gate_score = nn.Parameter(\n251\t            torch.full((cfg.intermediate_size,), gate_init, device=device)\n252\t        )\n253\t    \n254\t    def forward(self, x):\n255\t        inter = self.up_proj(x) * self.act_fn(self.gate_proj(x))\n256\t        # STE: hard_mask + (soft - stopgrad(soft))\n257\t        if self.training and hasattr(self, \"_batch_mask\"):\n258\t            hard_mask = self._batch_mask\n259\t            soft_prob = torch.sigmoid(self.gate_score / self.tau)\n260\t            z = hard_mask + (soft_prob - soft_prob.detach())\n261\t        return self.down_proj(inter * z)\n262\t\n263\t# Attention gate: per-KV-group scalar  \n264\tclass LlamaAttnGate(nn.Module):\n265\t    def __init__(self, cfg, layer_idx, src, gate_init, tau, device):\n266\t        self.gate_score_kv = nn.Parameter(\n267\t            torch.full((cfg.num_key_value_heads,), gate_init, device=device)\n268\t        )\n269\t    \n270\t    def forward(self, hidden_states, ...):\n271\t        # ... compute q, k, v, apply RoPE ...\n272\t        # Gate KV at head level\n273\t        kv_gate = z.view(1, -1, 1, 1)  # [1, num_kv_heads, 1, 1]\n274\t        k = k * kv_gate\n275\t        v = v * kv_gate\n276\t        # ... attention computation ...\n277\t```\n278\t\n279\t### 5.2 Budget Mask Projection (`pipeline.py`)\n280\t\n281\t```python\n282\tdef build_batch_budget_masks(model, f_cost, a_cost, keep_ratio, tau):\n283\t    scores, costs, holders = [], [], []\n284\t    for block in get_transformer_layers(model):\n285\t        # FFN gates\n286\t        values = sigmoid(block.mlp.gate_score.detach() / tau)\n287\t        scores.append(values); costs.append(full_like(values, f_cost))\n288\t        # KV gates\n289\t        values = sigmoid(block.self_attn.gate_score_kv.detach() / tau)\n290\t        scores.append(values); costs.append(full_like(values, a_cost))\n291\t    \n292\t    score_tensor = cat(scores)\n293\t    cost_tensor = cat(costs)\n294\t    budget = cost_tensor.sum() * keep_ratio\n295\t    \n296\t    # Greedy top-k by probability (not by cost-efficiency)\n297\t    order = argsort(score_tensor, descending=True)\n298\t    cumsum = cumsum(cost_tensor[order])\n299\t    chosen = order[cumsum <= budget]\n300\t    "}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Grq38H1uuBXWm7ctAsRR2q","session_id":"50085846-2f4c-49ad-8f2d-ef8b9b74cc58","uuid":"164b372d-d626-4eb8-848e-61cbabf0374f","timestamp":"2026-05-14T23:45:17.418Z"}
